WOU_ay39kTcamY2eIKfy6fWJqp-Uvryg&oe=6A9FF798"}, {"file_name": "\u2b50\ufe0e\u2b50\ufe0e\u30b7\u30fc\u30b1\u30f3\u30b9 02.00_10_00_01.\u9759\u6b62\u753b011.png", "id": "948420094258807", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619096_948420097592140_6800166696459121182_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JH7T7DSteRoQ7kNvwHirr_g&_nc_oc=AdpWkX2-tcadqin-ciQqIxQqgBpdXuCz_cx_DtW3h_QO7J-kSxO17LJgXR9-KXMlKE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJiVr2l9YYESYi-7t71DScMOGxQxSXznktICepai-g7DQ&oe=6AA021C4"}, {"file_name": "\u2b50\ufe0e\u2b50\ufe0e\u30b7\u30fc\u30b1\u30f3\u30b9 02.00_04_05_19.\u9759\u6b62\u753b017.png", "id": "1543972903366657", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308330_1543972906699990_3999552112831215925_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ywHH_RvQ0WAQ7kNvwFixyZH&_nc_oc=AdomBiMh5kR-Os-lSzCVpCVhAsAGxoYUDq3pANbqn-MAeF1dEqmhqm0TSEuCeJP7NHw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKqUdKB0zJ-7V00GRGyC1Qd93bwcWyAQ-zsKLI4mb9Krw&oe=6AA0167E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TableTopTank", "keywords": ["Tank", "Machine", "Robot", "Bot", "Battle"], "long_description": "# Overview\n\n**TableTopTank** is a spatial-invasion sci-fi MR/VR action game where your everyday space becomes the battlefield. Your room\u2014table, lighting blind spots, and floor boundaries\u2014is dynamically overwritten into a warzone, blending reality and digital threats.\n\n# Story\n\nIn 2045, the year of singularity, the Mars-born machine lifeforms known as the **\u201cOlympus Network\u201d** invade Earth to seize its vast **\u201cphysical simulation data.\u201d** Humanity hacks a captured prototype and finds a weakness in older models.\n\nYou remotely control the outdated unit **\u201cKasai Link,\u201d** infiltrating enemy systems from within. Using this fragile machine, you fight to shut down the core AI behind the invasion.\n\n# Enemy Forces\n\n- **Tharsis**: Swarming small tanks  \n- **Phobos Flyer**: Drones attacking from blind spots  \n- **Hellas Gigant**: Heavy tanks that crush real objects  \n- **Marineris**: Elite unit that distorts space and opens abysses  \n- **Arsia Core**: Central AI  \n- **Nix Olympia**: Final form that overwrites your entire room  \n\n# Gameplay\n\nYour key system is the **\u201cSync Rate.\u201d** As it improves, control becomes smoother and your unit evolves.\n\nFight directly within your real space, using positioning and awareness. Customize your loadout with modules dropped by enemies to adapt your strategy.\n\n# Core Experience\n\nExperience the collapse of reality and digital space. Your desk becomes a battlefield, and everyday objects turn into cover or threats\u2014your world is no longer safe.", "short_description": "In 2045, the \u201cOlympus Network,\u201d a mechanical lifeform from Mars, invades Earth to seize its \u201cphysical simulation data.\u201d You remotely control the stolen prototype \u201cKasai Link\u201d and fight on the table in your own room in a \u201creality-invading sci-fi\u201d MR/VR action experience. Drones strike from blind spots, tanks smash real objects, and elite units turn your floor into an abyss\u2014your everyday space becomes the battlefield.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://characterbank.atlassian.net/wiki/external/MWE4NWM2ZTFhNWVmNDQzYjlhZGE4NzczOGMzMDI5NDE", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://characterbank.atlassian.net/wiki/external/NzU2ZTljMjA2YTllNDNiMWJiNWJmOTYxODVjNWE2Njk", "publisher_name": "TV Asahi Corporation, CharacterBank Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://character-bank.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}]